{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602","id":3510581646,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tfdYs","number":111602,"title":"Core: Clean up `Geometry2D` and `Geometry3D`","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-10-13T15:53:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T18:51:10Z","closed_at":"2026-06-22T18:50:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111602","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Related to #111218\r\n\r\nA bit of a divergence from simply shuffling headers, as this aims to fix a related but *very* common problem across `core/math` specifically: waaaaaay too much logic confined to the headers. The only times you'd really want the logic in the header itself is:\r\n- Header-only libraries.\r\n- A function/class would see significant benefit from `constexpr`.\r\n- The logic is VERY few lines **and** doesn't require extra includes.\r\n- You're working with templates.\r\n  - Can *technically* work around with `extern` and explicit declarations, but uh, no.\r\n\r\n`Geometry2D` and `Geometry3D` fell into none of these camps. Both required a significant chunk of includes to handle the logic in their headers, when in virtually all cases we could just use forward-declaration instead. The only real exception was `Geometry3D` having to declare a struct, but it thankfully only needed to pull from `Plane` (one of the single best examples of forward-declares across `core/math`) and `LocalVector` (*might* be possible to trim down?), so it stayed fairly lean.\r\n\r\nPart of migrating the logic to the compilation files meant that there was no real need to keep any private logic in the header anymore. As such, and because the classes were never meant to be instantiated in the first place, both have been converted to namespaces instead. This better conveys the intent of the scoped functions, and might open the door to consolidating the logic of other namespace-esque classes cluttering `core/math` (ex: `Delaunay2D`/`Delaunay3D`).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}